## Pre-Publish Checklist (Phases 6-8 gates)

Before calling Phase 8, verify all items:

- [ ] Local `exchange_modules/` is on the latest `common-fragment-library` version from Exchange
- [ ] All `uses:` and `!include` paths in root RAML reference the new version folder
- [ ] `exchange.json` `name` field matches the human-readable display name (e.g., `"SFL Consents System API"`)
- [ ] `exchange.json` dependency `version` updated to latest `common-fragment-library` version
- [ ] `securedBy: [CommonLib.client-id-scheme]` — no direct `!include exchange_modules/.../securitySchemes/...`
- [ ] `postResponseType` (and any other params added in the latest resourceType.raml) present wherever `CommonLib.generic` is used
- [ ] No stale version strings (e.g., `1.0.2`) remaining anywhere in the spec folder
- [ ] **`exchange.json` contains `metadata` block** with `projectId`, `branchId`, and `commitId`
- [ ] Branch lock released after file upload (confirmed `{"locked": false}`)
- [ ] Publish call returns HTTP 200 with `assetId` in the response body

